@startuml
title C13 remote notebook synchronization
' Traces: OMCT-C13-L2-03.01, OMCT-C13-L2-03.02, OMCT-C13-L2-03.03
actor "Remote operator" as RemoteOperator
participant "Remote cupola Shell" as RemoteShell
participant "HttpObjectsGateway" as RemoteGateway
participant "Cupola.Api ObjectsController" as ObjectsController
participant "Cupola.Core IObjectStore" as Store
participant "RealtimeHub" as Hub
participant "SignalR RealtimeGateway" as RealtimeGateway
participant "ObjectUpdatesService" as Updates
participant "NotebookComponent" as Notebook
actor Operator

Operator -> Notebook: open observed notebook page
activate Notebook
Notebook -> Updates: subscribe(notebookKey)
activate Updates
Updates -> RealtimeGateway: objectUpdates(notebookKey)
activate RealtimeGateway
RealtimeGateway -> Hub: SubscribeToObject(notebookKey)
activate Hub
Hub --> RealtimeGateway: subscribed
deactivate Hub
RealtimeGateway --> Updates: update stream
deactivate RealtimeGateway
Updates --> Notebook: subscribed
deactivate Updates
Notebook --> Operator: display current entries
deactivate Notebook

RemoteOperator -> RemoteShell: modify notebook entry
activate RemoteShell
RemoteShell -> RemoteGateway: saveNotebook(changed notebook)
activate RemoteGateway
RemoteGateway -> ObjectsController: update domain object
activate ObjectsController
ObjectsController -> Store: persist notebook change
activate Store
Store --> ObjectsController: persisted notebook
deactivate Store
ObjectsController -> Hub: emit objectChanged
activate Hub
Hub -> RealtimeGateway: ObjectUpdated(persisted notebook)
activate RealtimeGateway
RealtimeGateway -> Updates: publish server update
activate Updates
alt entry modified
  Updates -> Notebook: update rendered entry
else entry added
  Updates -> Notebook: add rendered entry
else entry removed
  Updates -> Notebook: remove rendered entry
end
Updates --> RealtimeGateway: delivered
deactivate Updates
RealtimeGateway --> Hub: delivered
deactivate RealtimeGateway
Hub --> ObjectsController: broadcast complete
deactivate Hub
ObjectsController --> RemoteGateway: persisted notebook
deactivate ObjectsController
RemoteGateway --> RemoteShell: persisted notebook
deactivate RemoteGateway
RemoteShell --> RemoteOperator: change saved
deactivate RemoteShell
@enduml
